1
00:00:01,370 --> 00:00:03,320
Here you are.

2
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:08,030
Th-Thank you.

3
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,570
Two spoons...

4
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:23,290
Woo!

5
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:25,330
<i>You want us to eat together?!</i>

6
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:28,520
<i>You've really set me up, Hinako-san!</i>

7
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,490
It's so cute.

8
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:32,820
<i>Relax...</i>

9
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:36,060
<i>She's going to get all up in my face 
again if she finds out I'm flustered.</i>

10
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:42,170
She gave us two spoons.

11
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:43,410
You may as well have some.

12
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:46,280
Really? Can I? Yay!

13
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,140
Thank y—

14
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:53,300
<i>This situation is kind of...</i>

15
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:57,540
What's wrong? You aren't eating.

16
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:03,660
It feels like we're dating, doesn't it?

17
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:05,170
Did that get your heart racing?

18
00:01:05,170 --> 00:01:07,890
C-Could you not make stuff up?!

19
00:01:07,890 --> 00:01:10,350
I do this with Nacchan all the time!

20
00:01:10,830 --> 00:01:14,510
In fact, I wouldn't even 
mind sharing one spoon.

21
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:21,610
Here you go.

22
00:01:24,130 --> 00:01:26,060
<i>She's fighting back!</i>

23
00:01:26,060 --> 00:01:29,680
<i>She got me just the right 
amount of strawberry sauce, too.</i>

24
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,710
<i>Also, her face is so red!</i>

25
00:01:31,710 --> 00:01:33,480
<i>Why is she still insisting 
she isn't blushing?!</i>

26
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:36,040
<i>This isn't fair! 
Just throw it in already!</i>

27
00:01:36,850 --> 00:01:38,290
Hang on...

28
00:01:38,290 --> 00:01:40,460
Are you frozen?

29
00:01:40,460 --> 00:01:43,750
Did that startle you?

30
00:01:49,540 --> 00:01:51,590
What are you going on about? So stupid.

31
00:01:52,890 --> 00:01:56,320
He nommed it! He nommed it!

32
00:01:52,890 --> 00:01:59,310
AHHH, I FED HIM!                                                 AHHH, I FED HIM!                                                   AHHH, I FED HIM!                                                   AHHH, I FED HIM!                                                   AHHH, I FED HIM!                                                   AHHH, I FED HIM!                                                   AHHH, I FED HIM!                                                   AHHH, I FED HIM!

33
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:59,310
You're stupid for calling me stupid!

34
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,920
Besides...

35
00:02:08,030 --> 00:02:12,750
You're the one who gets 
excited over stuff like this.

36
00:02:15,770 --> 00:02:18,160
<i>I-I-Indirect kiss!</i>

37
00:02:18,540 --> 00:02:19,560
Well?

38
00:02:21,450 --> 00:02:24,380
<i>I-If I pull back now, I'll have lost.</i>

39
00:02:32,140 --> 00:02:35,550
<i>Until Yukiya really sees me as a girl,</i>

40
00:02:36,350 --> 00:02:39,170
<i>I absolutely can't lose.</i>

41
00:03:04,790 --> 00:03:07,380
You have a goofy look on your face.

42
00:03:11,870 --> 00:03:14,970
Lame! You're so annoying!

43
00:03:29,190 --> 00:03:33,410
I Want to End This Love Game

44
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:47,770
Episode 5
My Childhood Friend Comes In the Morning

45
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:47,770
Episode 5
My Childhood Friend Comes In the Morning

46
00:04:58,030 --> 00:04:59,500
Time to eat.

47
00:05:01,350 --> 00:05:02,410
Yum!

48
00:05:13,210 --> 00:05:18,470
Mom,
  Night shift must've been tough!!
  
 I made your favorite cheese katsu 
today!!
They came out nice.
Good luck at work!
                     Miku

49
00:05:13,210 --> 00:05:18,470
m 26.829 16.371 l -225.831 355.029 282.84 573.699 320.169 555.03 341.499 525.699 346.839 379.029 429.501 325.701 458.841 224.37 96.171 37.701

50
00:05:22,470 --> 00:05:24,340
Thanks for breakfast.

51
00:05:33,170 --> 00:05:37,150
I'm going to use this 
to finally stun Yukiya.

52
00:05:49,150 --> 00:05:51,090
Great.

53
00:05:52,190 --> 00:05:55,920
Mom, can we get another slice of bread?

54
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,970
The egg's ruined.

55
00:05:59,180 --> 00:06:02,080
<i>It </i>looked<i> better than last time...</i>

56
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:04,560
<i>Was it too hot?</i>

57
00:06:05,790 --> 00:06:07,120
That must be Miku-chan.

58
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:09,680
Isn't it a bit early?

59
00:06:13,860 --> 00:06:14,720
Morning.

60
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,280
Sorry I came early.

61
00:06:17,110 --> 00:06:19,570
<i>She has her hair down.</i>

62
00:06:19,570 --> 00:06:21,220
Wh-What's up?

63
00:06:21,220 --> 00:06:22,630
Is something wrong?

64
00:06:22,630 --> 00:06:25,870
Yeah, actually, I wanted to 
ask you for a favor.

65
00:06:26,290 --> 00:06:28,750
I hurt my finger during 
gym class yesterday,

66
00:06:28,750 --> 00:06:31,340
so I can't tie my hair properly.

67
00:06:31,750 --> 00:06:33,280
So...

68
00:06:33,280 --> 00:06:36,280
Could you tie my hair?

69
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:38,230
O-Okay.

70
00:06:38,230 --> 00:06:39,280
Come in.

71
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:40,530
Thanks.

72
00:06:41,590 --> 00:06:43,600
Is your finger okay, though?

73
00:06:50,140 --> 00:06:52,600
<i>It's a trap!</i>

74
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:55,470
<i>She's taking advantage 
of the fact that it's morning</i>

75
00:06:55,470 --> 00:06:58,490
<i>and I'm not emotionally ready!</i>

76
00:06:58,490 --> 00:06:59,620
'Kay.

77
00:06:59,620 --> 00:07:01,530
Tie it up neatly, please.

78
00:07:01,880 --> 00:07:04,200
<i>She's too pretty! I can't 
look directly at her!</i>

79
00:07:04,200 --> 00:07:05,660
O-Okay.

80
00:07:07,610 --> 00:07:10,340
<i>I'm just tying her hair. No big deal.</i>

81
00:07:10,340 --> 00:07:13,390
<i>Think about how many times 
I've done Wakana's hair.</i>

82
00:07:13,390 --> 00:07:17,550
<i>I'm so fast at making braids, 
I could write it in my resume.</i>

83
00:07:17,550 --> 00:07:21,220
<i>You aren't going to get my heart pounding 
just by touching your hair.</i>

84
00:07:27,050 --> 00:07:29,770
<i>Crap... Her hair...</i>

85
00:07:29,770 --> 00:07:32,470
<i>It smells so good.</i>

86
00:07:39,780 --> 00:07:42,170
Did you use something?

87
00:07:43,110 --> 00:07:44,760
Yup, I did.

88
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:47,290
Dad sent me some new stuff.

89
00:07:47,830 --> 00:07:51,040
Hm? Uh-oh, what's wrong?

90
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,370
Your hands aren't moving.

91
00:07:53,670 --> 00:07:57,230
Did your heart skip a beat?

92
00:08:00,630 --> 00:08:04,320
Your hair got in my nose. 
I was about to sneeze.

93
00:08:06,490 --> 00:08:09,260
<i>I could do anything to her 
with her back turned to me.</i>

94
00:08:09,260 --> 00:08:11,230
<i>She's being cocky.</i>

95
00:08:11,230 --> 00:08:12,780
You know...

96
00:08:12,780 --> 00:08:14,630
You're lying about stubbing your finger.

97
00:08:15,850 --> 00:08:17,850
I-It's not a lie.

98
00:08:17,850 --> 00:08:19,190
You can't even tie your hair.

99
00:08:19,190 --> 00:08:21,230
How could you bandage 
your hand so neatly?

100
00:08:21,230 --> 00:08:24,090
Such an elaborate trick 
first thing in the morning.

101
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:33,920
You really are needy, aren't you?

102
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:41,670
You used to like having your head patted 
like Wakana did, remember?

103
00:08:43,970 --> 00:08:47,550
But I guess now it means something 
different to you, doesn't it?

104
00:08:54,140 --> 00:08:56,230
There. You lose.

105
00:08:58,020 --> 00:08:59,870
<i>He kissed me!</i>

106
00:08:59,870 --> 00:09:00,800
<i>He actually kissed me!</i>

107
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:02,020
<i>He finally went and did it!</i>

108
00:09:02,020 --> 00:09:04,280
<i>Sensei! He kissed me!</i>

109
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:06,810
What? What?! Ew!

110
00:09:06,810 --> 00:09:09,120
Why did you think that would be okay?!

111
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:14,120
<i>Shoujo manga techniques fail again.</i>

112
00:09:19,890 --> 00:09:22,090
Speaking of when we were kids...

113
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:33,270
I liked touching your ears, remember?

114
00:09:33,270 --> 00:09:34,350
They're
so squishy!

115
00:09:33,270 --> 00:09:34,350
Stop
it!

116
00:09:34,350 --> 00:09:37,060
Your ears are still soft.

117
00:09:37,060 --> 00:09:39,060
Hey!

118
00:09:39,060 --> 00:09:42,860
What's this? Your ears are getting warm.

119
00:09:42,860 --> 00:09:45,360
Is your heart pounding?

120
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:47,240
Y-You're imagining it.

121
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:49,340
Your ears are softer.

122
00:09:49,340 --> 00:09:51,050
Go touch your own.

123
00:09:53,530 --> 00:09:54,240
Then...

124
00:09:55,290 --> 00:09:57,080
Why don't we compare?

125
00:10:31,780 --> 00:10:33,260
Thanks!

126
00:10:31,780 --> 00:10:43,670
squish      squish      squish      squish      squish      squish      squish      squish      squish

127
00:10:33,260 --> 00:10:35,780
Gotta have my morning ear massage.

128
00:10:35,780 --> 00:10:37,310
R-R-Right?

129
00:10:37,310 --> 00:10:39,200
Ear massages regulate your 
autonomous nervous system

130
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:41,530
and even help you lose weight, right.

131
00:10:41,530 --> 00:10:43,670
What are you, axolotls?

132
00:10:43,670 --> 00:10:46,460
You should probably do it too, Wakana.

133
00:10:46,460 --> 00:10:47,260
Pass.

134
00:10:47,260 --> 00:10:49,920
More importantly, it's almost 8.

135
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:50,980
Already?!

136
00:10:50,980 --> 00:10:53,390
I-I'm going to get my bag.

137
00:10:53,790 --> 00:10:55,150
Want me to get your shoes for you?

138
00:10:55,150 --> 00:10:56,240
It's fine.

139
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:58,710
Stop meddling to try to hide 
your shame. It's annoying.

140
00:11:08,450 --> 00:11:13,200
<i>Not that it's surprising, 
but his hand's grown bigger.</i>

141
00:11:14,510 --> 00:11:18,540
<i>Maybe I'll ask him 
to put my hair up again.</i>

142
00:11:20,670 --> 00:11:22,290
We're off.

143
00:11:25,900 --> 00:11:31,460
<i>Her high school uniform's nice, but 
her middle school one was cute, too</i>

144
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:36,180
Wakana, there are more
acupressure points on the ears
than on the neck.

145
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:36,180
Okay, okay, onii.

146
00:11:38,610 --> 00:11:41,760
Oh yeah, what did you do with 
your middle school uniform?

147
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:45,940
I think I'll give it to my 
mom's friend's daughter.

148
00:11:45,940 --> 00:11:47,600
She's starting next year.

149
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:53,210
What's wrong? You look disappointed.

150
00:11:53,210 --> 00:11:54,810
Do you want me to wear it?

151
00:11:54,810 --> 00:11:56,950
And then what, perv?

152
00:11:56,950 --> 00:11:59,200
You're so cold.

153
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:01,980
Don't you have any good memories 
attached to your uniform?

154
00:12:11,670 --> 00:12:15,430
I guess I can keep it 
if you really insist.

155
00:12:15,430 --> 00:12:19,640
O-Oh? I see. Huh.

156
00:12:21,660 --> 00:12:23,240
"Cold" my butt!

157
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:25,350
He definitely looked like 
he wanted me to wear it!

158
00:12:25,350 --> 00:12:27,350
He can be a real perv sometimes.

159
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:33,900
What if I made a move 
on him wearing this?

160
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:39,550
No, no, that would make me the pervert!

161
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:44,040
I Want to End This Love Game

162
00:12:45,530 --> 00:12:47,040
So, Wakana,

163
00:12:47,950 --> 00:12:51,320
why didn't you tell them you 
have a curfew and come home?

164
00:12:52,020 --> 00:12:55,130
My friend wanted my advice on something.

165
00:12:55,130 --> 00:12:58,180
I lost track of the time 
and forgot to message you.

166
00:12:58,180 --> 00:13:00,180
That'd better be true.

167
00:13:00,180 --> 00:13:03,730
Out so late? All dressed up?

168
00:13:03,730 --> 00:13:05,500
Where were you talking to them?

169
00:13:05,500 --> 00:13:07,150
Who's your friend?

170
00:13:07,150 --> 00:13:09,730
Is your friend a guy or a girl?

171
00:13:11,070 --> 00:13:12,530
Come on!

172
00:13:12,530 --> 00:13:14,290
Shut up!

173
00:13:14,610 --> 00:13:18,440
Mom just gave me 
the same lecture a minute ago!

174
00:13:18,440 --> 00:13:20,050
For a whole hour!

175
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:23,700
I know I should have messaged Mom,

176
00:13:23,700 --> 00:13:25,810
but you don't need get 
on my case too, Onii!

177
00:13:25,810 --> 00:13:28,420
I'm just worried about you.

178
00:13:28,420 --> 00:13:30,480
You're such a pain!

179
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:33,980
Why do I need to tell you 
about everything?!

180
00:13:33,980 --> 00:13:38,640
You think I'm the kind of person who does 
bad things behind your back, don't you?

181
00:13:38,640 --> 00:13:40,780
That's not really the point.

182
00:13:41,420 --> 00:13:42,520
Forget it.

183
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,790
Go away!

184
00:13:44,550 --> 00:13:46,070
Fine, fine.

185
00:13:52,150 --> 00:13:54,960
I messed up.

186
00:14:00,740 --> 00:14:03,790
Miku

187
00:14:03,790 --> 00:14:05,100
Yukiya?

188
00:14:05,100 --> 00:14:07,590
I'm done with my chores. 
Ready for some Squidtoon?

189
00:14:10,580 --> 00:14:11,780
<i>What's wrong?</i>

190
00:14:11,780 --> 00:14:13,010
<i>You sound a bit bummed.</i>

191
00:14:13,010 --> 00:14:16,580
No, well, Wakana and I just...

192
00:14:20,930 --> 00:14:24,010
<i>Actually, wanna go to 
the convenience store for a bit?</i>

193
00:14:24,720 --> 00:14:26,850
Okay, sure.

194
00:14:26,850 --> 00:14:30,710
I was just in the mood 
for something sweet.

195
00:14:33,450 --> 00:14:37,110
Sad. Wakana-chan hates you.

196
00:14:37,950 --> 00:14:39,870
So now you're all bummed.

197
00:14:43,030 --> 00:14:47,000
You can be a bit excessive 
about Wakana-chan.

198
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:51,780
Curfew's important, but she gets 
annoyed by you because you keep prying.

199
00:14:51,780 --> 00:14:53,730
Maybe you should trust her some more.

200
00:14:53,730 --> 00:14:57,260
Again, it isn't about 
whether I trust her or not.

201
00:14:57,260 --> 00:15:00,430
It's just not safe coming home so late.

202
00:15:00,430 --> 00:15:02,010
Especially because she's cute.

203
00:15:02,010 --> 00:15:04,220
I get it, but...

204
00:15:04,220 --> 00:15:09,810
Aren't you happier if she comes 
home smiling after having fun

205
00:15:09,810 --> 00:15:14,400
than if she has to come home because her 
annoying brother's getting on her case?

206
00:15:28,700 --> 00:15:31,960
Read

207
00:15:28,700 --> 00:15:31,960
Today

208
00:15:28,700 --> 00:15:31,960
Just
read

209
00:15:28,700 --> 00:15:31,960
Let's just forget about it.

210
00:15:28,700 --> 00:15:31,960
What were you doing out so late?

211
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:36,380
I was at the culture festival after-party.

212
00:15:38,640 --> 00:15:41,150
Smiling, huh?

213
00:15:42,700 --> 00:15:46,390
Why not help her out when 
she really needs the help?

214
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:48,190
Don't be dumb.

215
00:15:48,190 --> 00:15:50,790
I can't swoop in at the last 
minute like in a drama.

216
00:15:50,790 --> 00:15:52,600
That's why I'm being this way.

217
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:55,130
She gets annoyed when I worry 
about her preemptively.

218
00:15:55,130 --> 00:15:57,410
But I have to help her 
when she's in a pinch?

219
00:15:57,410 --> 00:15:58,680
That's stupid.

220
00:15:58,680 --> 00:16:00,700
But wouldn't it be pretty badass

221
00:16:00,700 --> 00:16:03,830
if you were the hero who 
showed up when she's in a pinch?

222
00:16:05,640 --> 00:16:07,410
This kid...

223
00:16:16,380 --> 00:16:18,550
You'd better be careful, too.

224
00:16:18,550 --> 00:16:20,840
You have a cute face, if nothing else.

225
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:22,600
Huh? What's that supposed to mean?

226
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:24,520
Also, I'm totally fine.

227
00:16:24,520 --> 00:16:26,090
No worries.

228
00:16:26,090 --> 00:16:28,390
I have a pretty painful punch.

229
00:16:28,390 --> 00:16:30,410
And I can run away if I have to.

230
00:16:30,410 --> 00:16:32,480
I'm a fast runner.

231
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:38,360
At night, 
push the button

232
00:16:34,390 --> 00:16:37,020
Seriously, what's with the sighing?

233
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:42,490
No, that's messed up for real.

234
00:16:42,490 --> 00:16:44,110
Right? It's hella messed.

235
00:16:49,240 --> 00:16:51,090
Messed up for real for real.

236
00:16:51,090 --> 00:16:52,890
Straight up messed up.

237
00:16:52,890 --> 00:16:55,880
So messed up that it's messed up.

238
00:17:01,560 --> 00:17:02,760
Told you.

239
00:17:09,890 --> 00:17:15,310
If you're <i>that</i> worried about me, 
I'd love if you protected me, Yukiya.

240
00:17:18,590 --> 00:17:20,560
You don't even care about 
what I'm going through.

241
00:17:20,980 --> 00:17:21,980
Huh?

242
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:38,380
I kinda get how Wakana-chan feels.

243
00:17:39,460 --> 00:17:44,980
The first time you use a knife, 
the first time you go out with friends...

244
00:17:44,980 --> 00:17:48,970
Girls get lectured 
all sorts of ways every time.

245
00:17:48,970 --> 00:17:51,180
It makes you go, "Urgh..."

246
00:17:51,180 --> 00:17:53,070
The same happened to me, too.

247
00:17:53,070 --> 00:17:55,310
It's frustrating the moment it happens.

248
00:17:56,330 --> 00:18:00,480
But it's because I'm cared for.

249
00:18:01,070 --> 00:18:04,030
And of course she appreciates that.

250
00:18:04,030 --> 00:18:07,840
I'm sure Wakana-chan understands 
that you're worried for her.

251
00:18:07,840 --> 00:18:09,860
You've always been her big brother.

252
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:12,830
Holding her hand so she doesn't fall.

253
00:18:13,550 --> 00:18:15,700
Sticking by her side when she's crying.

254
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:18,580
Patting her head when she's sad.

255
00:18:18,580 --> 00:18:21,790
Letting her hang out when 
she can't keep up with her friends.

256
00:18:24,600 --> 00:18:27,300
I've done all that for her?

257
00:18:30,420 --> 00:18:33,810
I might have embellished a bit.

258
00:18:35,850 --> 00:18:40,810
Anyway, point is, she gets 
why people are worried.

259
00:18:41,140 --> 00:18:43,900
Maybe she didn't want to 
be scolded by her brother.

260
00:18:43,900 --> 00:18:46,070
She probably wanted you 
to be on her side.

261
00:18:47,230 --> 00:18:49,610
You don't need get on my case too, Onii!

262
00:18:50,490 --> 00:18:52,320
Dunno about that.

263
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:54,830
Pakico    Café au lait
Creamy Frozen Smoothie

264
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:54,830
A flavor that melts on your tongue
Coffee & Milk

265
00:19:01,220 --> 00:19:02,640
<i>Halfsies.</i>

266
00:19:04,190 --> 00:19:06,670
<i>He can go a bit overboard,</i>

267
00:19:06,980 --> 00:19:09,670
<i>but the way he's always 
a proper brother...</i>

268
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:13,300
There's a new version 
of the one we always buy.

269
00:19:13,300 --> 00:19:15,550
<i>That's what I like about him.</i>

