Limited Time

273
00:19:19,180 --> 00:19:20,210
Thanks.

274
00:19:24,520 --> 00:19:27,570
I know I said too much,

275
00:19:27,570 --> 00:19:30,940
but I have a feeling I'll do 
the same thing if she does it again.

276
00:19:31,370 --> 00:19:34,750
And she'll get angry again.

277
00:19:34,750 --> 00:19:36,080
And then...

278
00:19:36,080 --> 00:19:38,030
You're so lecturey.

279
00:19:36,080 --> 00:19:47,420
Trashy

280
00:19:38,030 --> 00:19:41,390
I like my trashy guy more. He gets me.

281
00:19:41,390 --> 00:19:44,530
Peace! Woo! 'Sup dawg, you seein' this?

282
00:19:44,530 --> 00:19:46,080
I don't need you anymore, Onii.

283
00:19:46,080 --> 00:19:47,060
Bye-bye!

284
00:19:47,060 --> 00:19:49,900
I might lose Wakana.

285
00:19:49,900 --> 00:19:50,900
You're an idiot.

286
00:19:50,900 --> 00:19:54,010
Don't worry. Just trust her.

287
00:19:54,010 --> 00:19:57,310
You always brush it off like it's nothing.

288
00:19:57,310 --> 00:20:00,440
It's not a matter of trust.

289
00:20:00,440 --> 00:20:03,810
No girl's going to stick around 
with her older brother forever.

290
00:20:04,280 --> 00:20:06,650
Especially with the way I am.

291
00:20:08,050 --> 00:20:13,610
She might just wander off with 
some cute guy who sounds fun.

292
00:20:18,970 --> 00:20:22,000
You're a perfectly awesome big brother.

293
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:23,320
You'll be fine.

294
00:20:26,330 --> 00:20:29,180
You blushed!

295
00:20:26,330 --> 00:20:30,340
Ice Pearls
Mitarashi Dango
Flavor

296
00:20:26,330 --> 00:20:30,340
Limited Time

297
00:20:30,340 --> 00:20:31,740
Stop messing with me!

298
00:20:34,720 --> 00:20:38,750
Will you always be by my side, too?

299
00:20:39,350 --> 00:20:41,590
What was that?

300
00:20:42,280 --> 00:20:43,520
Nothing.

301
00:20:49,130 --> 00:20:52,940
