was thinking when he put them there,

325
00:23:31,350 --> 00:23:32,710
and it's so gross!

326
00:23:32,710 --> 00:23:33,550
"Be mine."

327
00:23:33,550 --> 00:23:35,730
Ew! Ew! Ew!

